      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Sweep several checkpoints via a PyList\n\nThree checkpoints collected with List-Utils **Create PyList** into one `model`-type Sweep Dimension (via `values_pylist`, so no MODEL sockets are needed), crossed with 2 seeds: 6 images and a grid.\n\nPick your three checkpoints. Prompts use the first checkpoint's CLIP; filenames tag models as checkpoint0/1/2.\n\nSee NODE_GUIDE.md, workflow 6."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
